d 'CRUCEANDINO': module to compute one-step multiway crosstabulation of an outcome by one to three categorical variables
d
d  This routine produces a one-step multiway crosstabulation of an
d outcome by one to three categorical variables, producing a
d coherent table (framework table/collect, exportable to
d md/docx/html/tex) and a matching figure, with consistent labels
d and percentages. 
d
d KW: crosstabulation
d KW: categorical variables
d KW: graphics
d
d Requires: Stata version 17
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261003
d
d Author: Juan Marcelo Gutierrez Miranda,  TodoEconometria
d Support: email  juangutierrez@@todoeconometria.com
d
f cruceandino.ado
f cruceandino.sthlp
